  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After more than ten days of sovereign immortal aperture time, Fang Yuan obtains Xia Cha’s four Immortal Gu. They form a complete set: Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. Spring Gu and summer Gu are rank eight, while autumn Gu and winter Gu are rank seven. All four are time path Immortal Gu.",
